Check 10513 with 7113 PM Counters Expected values
    [Documentation]                 To Check 8940 PM counter values are as exepected
    [Arguments]                     ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected}
    Dated Log                       =======================================================================
    Dated Log                       PM counter : ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}
    Dated Log                       --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_1}=            Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_1_idx}
    Dated Log                         Value of PM counter : ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID} : cell : ${NRCELLID_1_idx} : ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_1}
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_2}=            Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_2_idx}
    Dated Log                         Value of PM counter : ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID} : cell : ${NRCELLID_2_idx} : ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_2}
    ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_3}=            Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID}       ${NRCELLID_3_idx}
    Dated Log                         Value of PM counter : ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.PM_ID} : cell : ${NRCELLID_3_idx} : ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_3}

    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_1} == ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.CELL_1_Expected}
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_2} == ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.CELL_2_Expected}
    #should be true      7800000 < ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_2} <= 7850000
    should be true      ${Value_PM_Counter_Cell_3} == ${8940_PM_Counters_Expected.CELL_3_Expected}


Check pooling Counters
    [Documentation]                 M55308C10005 and M55308C10006 UL and DL BB POOL Counters
    Dated Log New Line          =================================================================
    Dated Log                      PM Counter: M55308C10005
    Dated Log                   =================================================================
    Dated Log                              Waiting 6 minutes before checking counter
    sleep                                  360s
    ${date}                                Get Current Date
    ${date_in_dir_name}                    Convert Date         ${date}     result_format=%d%m%Y_%H%M
    ${log_path_pm}                         Set Variable         ${LOG_PATH}/PM_${date_in_dir_name}
    Dated Log                              The PM counters file collected from gnb will be stored under : ${log_path_pm}
    ${pm_latest}                           Counters.Collect PM files from BTS      ${log_path_pm}
    set Suite Variable                     ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${pm_latest}
    set Suite Variable                     ${log_path_pm}
    Dated Log                              Latest pm counters file : ${LATEST_PM_FILE}
    ${DL_BB_POOL_Counter}     Set Variable     M55308C10005
    ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_1}=        Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${DL_BB_POOL_Counter}       1
    Dated Log                              Value of DL_BB_POOL_Counter for Cell 1 : ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_1}
    should be true                         ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_1} == 128160000
    ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_2}=        Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${DL_BB_POOL_Counter}       2
    Dated Log                              Value of DL_BB_POOL_Counter or Cell 2 : ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_2}
    should be true                         ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_2} == 20925000
    ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_3}=        Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${DL_BB_POOL_Counter}       3
    Dated Log                              Value of DL_BB_POOL_Counter for Cell 3 : ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_3}
    should be true                         ${Value_PM_DL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_3} == 113827500
    ${UL_BB_POOL_Counter}     Set Variable     M55308C10006
    ${Value_PM_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_1}=        Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${UL_BB_POOL_Counter}       1
    Dated Log                              Value of UL_BB_POOL_Counter for Cell 1 : ${Value_PM_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_1}
    should be true                         ${Value_PM_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_1} == 28800000
    ${Value_PM_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_2}=        Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
    ...                                    ${LATEST_PM_FILE}       ${UL_BB_POOL_Counter}       2
    Dated Log                              Value of UL_BB_POOL_Counter or Cell 2 : ${Value_PM_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_2}
    should be true                         ${Value_PM_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_2} == 28800000
    ${Value_PM_UL_BB_POOL_Counter_Cell_3}=        Counters.Retrieve Latest Single Counter Value From Pm File with CellID
